    {
      "id": "92-S3-R4",
      "description": "第一夜写有饭仍冷、等候仍无期限及睡毡成本；尚未落实的茜雪包裹/厚袜不提前当作已到宝玉手中，后场仍须依规则实际交付。",
      "status": "PENDING",
      "scope": "CURRENT_IMPLEMENTATION_REQUIREMENT_NOT_HISTORICAL_FACT",
      "grounding": {
        "seed": {
          "path": "data/prewrite/v06.json",
          "pointer": "/omitted_scene_plans/11/candidate_scenes/2",
          "ref": "data/prewrite/v06.json#/omitted_scene_plans/11/candidate_scenes/2",
          "sha256": "caaa49d2f61760be27df0c9cbbc00433b6d54999199e08caec8260c8b15287ff",
          "text_sha256": "51d114b3ef4eb21bad148999c4108335d34ec5ca1346abd70d3f6aea3e42c25c",
          "value": {
            "id": "92-S3",
            "title": "羁押第一夜必须写“规则学习”"
          }
        },
        "chapter_card_fields": [
          {
            "citation": {
              "byte_range": [
                31264,
                31534
              ],
              "lines": [
                780,
                782
              ],
              "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
              "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
              "text_sha256": "af0a58a3a34bbfed6c415bc3ee97a025838f0bad479a929041e0afe1efad5649"
            },
            "name": "最强处 / P-Lock",
            "number": 2,
            "text": "**2｜最强处 / P-Lock**  \n等候、冷茶、湿鞋泥、粗瓷碗、萝卜、毡、饭钱规则；宝玉先学“不能换碗”；小红先问规则；茜雪只管冷不冷、送袜；最后回窄巷；现有“正是”二句为81—100唯一作者韵化收束。\n\n"
          },
          {
            "citation": {
              "byte_range": [
                31700,
                31908
              ],
              "lines": [
                786,
                788
              ],
              "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
              "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
              "text_sha256": "4e9955259a25cacca5651767990721298088a9e0a8ab597e8a6de8d12f908d41"
            },
            "name": "缺失情节",
            "number": 4,
            "text": "**4｜缺失情节**  \n92-S1认单≠定罪；S2第一次留质家里不知多久；S3第一夜规则学习；S4小红办能不能送；S5茜雪办保暖；S6第二轮问讯使范围缩小；正常释放。\n\n"
          },
          {
            "citation": {
              "byte_range": [
                32693,
                32881
              ],
              "lines": [
                808,
                810
              ],
              "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
              "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
              "text_sha256": "5142c870dc1c08deab17bed386e12efd04fd25facc0a6f149133cdf67cc9acf7"
            },
            "name": "四链",
            "number": 11,
            "text": "**11｜四链**  \n钱：钱只能改善饭、跑腿、送物，不能买结案。物：厚袜、粗饭、毡、包裹。信：家里最初只知“留一留”，信息延迟是痛点。\n\n"
          },
          {
            "citation": {
              "byte_range": [
                32881,
                33000
              ],
              "lines": [
                811,
                813
              ],
              "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
              "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
              "text_sha256": "8596aa8683a9192f0c6b028d9c727daa9e9a27f73ce19de3ecf82cab5c08c62b"
            },
            "name": "必须保留",
            "number": 12,
            "text": "**12｜必须保留**  \n萝卜、鞋袜、毡、碗受控；小红问规则；茜雪厚袜；狱神灯；不劫狱。\n\n"
          },
          {
            "citation": {
              "byte_range": [
                33398,
                33795
              ],
              "lines": [
                826,
                829
              ],
              "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
              "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
              "text_sha256": "fb8033734c34167c334c5c15e4ff3e09d2a92e4fc9451811424991f81a7d1565"
            },
            "name": "章法 / 风险",
            "number": 18,
            "text": "**18｜章法 / 风险**  \n传问等候 → 留质突然发生 → 第一夜规则 → 家中信息断裂 → 小红制度性帮助 → 茜雪旧情保暖 → 第二轮问讯 → 范围收窄 → 正常释放 → 饭香/窄门。  \n**压力测试问题：**是否既有法律可信度又仍是小说；小红帮助是否“大得力”但不传奇；宗教是否真实存在却完全不救案。\n\n"
          }
        ],
        "world_records": [
          {
            "ref": "data/objects/m4.json#/transitions/9",
            "path": "data/objects/m4.json",
            "pointer": "/transitions/9",
