  ],
  "forbidden_beats": [
    {
      "id": "92-S3-F1",
      "description": "不得显灵、许愿获释、神迹翻案或用佛理解释处置；也不得造酷刑和地牢冒险。",
      "status": "PENDING",
      "scope": "CURRENT_IMPLEMENTATION_REQUIREMENT_NOT_HISTORICAL_FACT",
      "grounding": {
        "seed": {
          "path": "data/prewrite/v06.json",
          "pointer": "/omitted_scene_plans/11/candidate_scenes/2",
          "ref": "data/prewrite/v06.json#/omitted_scene_plans/11/candidate_scenes/2",
          "sha256": "caaa49d2f61760be27df0c9cbbc00433b6d54999199e08caec8260c8b15287ff",
          "text_sha256": "51d114b3ef4eb21bad148999c4108335d34ec5ca1346abd70d3f6aea3e42c25c",
          "value": {
            "id": "92-S3",
            "title": "羁押第一夜必须写“规则学习”"
          }
        },
        "chapter_card_fields": [
          {
            "citation": {
              "byte_range": [
                30851,
                31264
              ],
              "lines": [
                772,
                779
              ],
              "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
              "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
              "text_sha256": "747f3dded7f17758329dc18f6add30897c7b5175d8bbaafa7a3dc93209b1f75b"
            },
            "name": "硬节点",
            "number": 1,
            "text": "**1｜硬节点**  \nR05\n\n**EVIDENCE-INTERFACES｜**\n- T2/DRAFT-LABEL：`狱神庙慰宝玉`；\n- V5：`茜雪至狱神庙方呈正文`、`红玉茜雪一大回文字`、`红玉后有宝玉大得力处`；\n- **W2已裁：`狱庙相逢` = OPEN-W2 / NO-ACTIVE-INSERTION。92明确不加巧姐/刘姥姥。**/R30/R31/R32；H01/H02；O02开放具体法律接口。必须是真实羁押/待质，不是地牢传奇。\n\n"
          },
          {
            "citation": {
              "byte_range": [
                32032,
                32122
              ],
              "lines": [
                792,
                794
              ],
              "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
              "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
              "text_sha256": "d04bf41f68c9501dcc1051d2b002387123fb9913f9c2a024dcac3f86ddda2163"
            },
            "name": "文化",
            "number": 6,
            "text": "**6｜文化**  \n38禁补；粗歌若有也不必。宗教只许狱神日常微仪式。\n\n"
          },
          {
            "citation": {
              "byte_range": [
                32368,
                32543
              ],
              "lines": [
                802,
                804
              ],
              "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
              "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
              "text_sha256": "505e136dc042e1ca76f88589f7a3e758d90aa234abba76b692a1548d9583299d"
            },
            "name": "宗教/梦",
            "number": 9,
            "text": "**9｜宗教/梦**  \n41-P：狱神一盏灯、烟熏顶棚。若增，只加小役剪灯花/添油，老囚随手合掌而另一个人不理。绝不显灵、许愿获释。\n\n"
          },
          {
            "citation": {
              "byte_range": [
                33000,
                33107
              ],
              "lines": [
                814,
                816
              ],
              "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
              "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
              "text_sha256": "993cf13ed67f3f2e9aebcca285d5bf370934ee2e4425c9fd83a70b10d548b615"
            },
            "name": "应删",
            "number": 13,
            "text": "**13｜应删**  \n酷刑、屈打成招、大反派、权贵搭救、神迹翻案；“男丁连坐”。\n\n"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "92-S3-F2",
      "description": "不得写人物诗、扩文化雅趣或把第一夜的饭鞋小话写成轻松喜剧。",
      "status": "PENDING",
      "scope": "CURRENT_IMPLEMENTATION_REQUIREMENT_NOT_HISTORICAL_FACT",
      "grounding": {
        "seed": {
          "path": "data/prewrite/v06.json",
          "pointer": "/omitted_scene_plans/11/candidate_scenes/2",
          "ref": "data/prewrite/v06.json#/omitted_scene_plans/11/candidate_scenes/2",
          "sha256": "caaa49d2f61760be27df0c9cbbc00433b6d54999199e08caec8260c8b15287ff",
          "text_sha256": "51d114b3ef4eb21bad148999c4108335d34ec5ca1346abd70d3f6aea3e42c25c",
          "value": {
            "id": "92-S3",
            "title": "羁押第一夜必须写“规则学习”"
          }
        },
        "chapter_card_fields": [
          {
            "citation": {
              "byte_range": [
                32032,
                32122
              ],
              "lines": [
                792,
                794
              ],
              "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
              "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
              "text_sha256": "d04bf41f68c9501dcc1051d2b002387123fb9913f9c2a024dcac3f86ddda2163"
            },
            "name": "文化",
            "number": 6,
            "text": "**6｜文化**  \n38禁补；粗歌若有也不必。宗教只许狱神日常微仪式。\n\n"
          },
          {
            "citation": {
              "byte_range": [
                32122,
                32271
              ],
              "lines": [
                795,
                798
              ],
              "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
              "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
              "text_sha256": "fd06c6797c1d1fc992b71c98caf02a88caa2030abb12c7f15497e1210b286e26"
            },
            "name": "诗文身份",
            "number": 7,
            "text": "**7｜诗文身份**  \n无人物诗。作者韵文只保留现有：\n“门里十日，只知饭冷灯昏；门外一程，才觉人间路窄。”\n\n"
          },
          {
            "citation": {
              "byte_range": [
                32271,
                32368
              ],
              "lines": [
                799,
                801
              ],
              "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
              "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
              "text_sha256": "053200c1498097e00af82bfbf2f69beb66c0f7774ce0a5c6d613d473ae587ed3"
            },
            "name": "笑料",
            "number": 8,
            "text": "**8｜笑料**  \n同监关于饭、鞋、规矩的小话可保；不能喜剧化司法威胁。\n\n"
          }
        ]
      }
